<p>It seems like the kind of horror you would find in the SCP foundation, however there are a few things i think are wrong with it:</p>
<p>1: Does the Foundation have that technology to get spaceships up there? (like actually i dont know if they do)</p>
<p>2: If the Foundation could reach it, that would mean it is close enough to earth for a ship to reach relatively easily, so NASA would have probably noticed it and gotten the word out to the public.</p>
<p>3: Kinda seems like a Space-SCP-106 if you ask me. Pulling people into walls and killing them.</p>

