<p>Thanks for your feedback.</p>
<p>1: There are a number ob SCP entries where the Foundation has advanced technology, sometimes even FTL capable vessels. So I think having a ship capable of travelling the solar system is normal for the Foundation.</p>
<p>2: I have not said it in the idea but I would set the SCP in a rather close orbit around the sun, thus it is very unlikely that anyone besides the Foundation / Foundation assets in gov space programs would find the SCP.</p>
<p>3: Well, the behavour of 106 is different, since it's main thing is to corrode things and pull people into another dimension. This SCP would leave structures intact, only attack within atmosphere and pulls people (partially) inside the walls but otherwise leaving them in our world. I will adjust the OP a bit to make that more clear.</p>

