<p>Thanks for the crit.</p>
<p>I thought about it for a few days and I think I overhauled the idea in a good way. The ship is now capable of (time)travel via another dimension and the entity maybe doesn't want to kill the humans. Also they are not directly melted anymore but sort of dissolved into atoms / molecules.</p>
